---
// InvitationSection.astro - Master Section 03: An Invitation
---

<section class="invitation-section" id="join" aria-labelledby="join-heading">
  <div class="container invitation-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow" data-animate="fade-up">— 03 / AN INVITATION</p>
      <h2 id="join-heading" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="100">
        Help shape <em>our first</em><br />shade range.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="invitation-right">
      <p class="desc" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="150">
        We're inviting people across India to tell us what has worked, what hasn't, and what they've been looking for in complexion products.
      </p>
      <p class="desc-sub" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="250">
        Start with a short survey. Your perspective can help inform Sāmya's founding research.
      </p>
      <div data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="350">
        <button class="btn btn-wine" type="button" data-open-modal aria-haspopup="dialog">
          Join our founding research
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="disclaimer" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="400">
        Selected participants may be invited to receive a complimentary shade-testing kit. Our shade library and kits are in development; participation does not guarantee a kit.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .invitation-section {
    padding: 85px 0 95px;
    background: var(--porcelain);
    position: relative;
  }

  .invitation-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 0.85fr);
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--wine);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .invitation-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(48px, 5.2vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.02;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--plum);
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .invitation-section h2 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--wine);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .invitation-right {
    max-width: 460px;
  }

  .desc {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .desc-sub {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }

  .btn-wine {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 48px;
    padding: 0 32px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: var(--wine);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(118, 2, 46, 0.2);
    transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease-spring), background-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .btn-wine:hover {
    background: #5d0224;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(118, 2, 46, 0.32);
  }

  .btn-wine:active {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .disclaimer {
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--wine);
    max-width: 440px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .invitation-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .invitation-section {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }
    .invitation-section h2 {
      font-size: 42px;
    }
  }
</style>
